{"game": "escape-from-duckov", "language": "english", "appid": 3167020, "month": "2026-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1786147200, "end_date": 1786838399, "month_true_total": 104, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-26 01:38:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "232903546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198361390861", "personaname": "amirali.shemirani", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198361390861/", "num_games_owned": 28, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6676, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1178, "playtime_at_review": 2388, "last_played": 1789855617, "avatar": "92620c2e5f15b278cb3cdd90670b9f4c94634783"}, "language": "english", "review": "Escape from Duckov is a great game! The gameplay feels really well balanced, with great mechanics, fun survival elements, and nice maps to explore. There’s a good variety of guns, gear, upgrades, and items to loot and gather, which makes progression really satisfying.\n\nThe missions are fun, the story is decent, and I really enjoy collecting resources, upgrading my character and base, and finding better equipment. There’s always something to work toward.\n\nOne of my favorite things is that it’s completely offline, so you can manage your own progression and play at your own pace. No pressure, no competing with other players, just survive, loot, upgrade, and enjoy the game.\n\nReally addictive and a lot of fun. Definitely recommend it!", "timestamp_created": 1786814634, "timestamp_updated": 1786814634, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232882290", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011171529", "personaname": "Dry Leaves", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/